ore critical? Long-distance flights require clear communication, especially with crew and ATC. Difficulty communicating ideas could be a safety risk. Egocentric may affect teamwork. B's pretentiousness and tone issues also affect crew but maybe less severe. So B still seems best.\n\nThus we produce final public message summarizing as before, maybe with confidence 60-65%. Provide metadata vote B.\n\nProceed."}
